### Instruction:
Write code in Java to sort an array of integers in ascending order.

### Input:
[5, 2, 8, 10, 4, 9]

### Response:
public static void sortAscending(int[] arr) {
    for(int i = 0; i < arr.length - 1; i++) {
        int min = i;
        for (int j = i + 1; j < arr.length; j++) {
            if (arr[j] < arr[min]) {
                min = j;
            }
        }
        int tmp = arr[i];
        arr[i] = arr[min];
        arr[min] = tmp;
    }
}

