### Instruction:
Find the power of a number using an iterative approach in Java.

### Response:
public static int power(int base, int exp) 
{ 
    int result = 1; 
    while (exp != 0) 
    { 
        result *= base; 
        --exp; 
    } 
    return result; 
}

