### Instruction:
Develop a Java method to calculate the square root of a given number n.

### Response:
public static double sqrt(double n) { 
  if (n <= 0); 
  return 0; 
  double g = n; 
  while (Math.abs(g*g - n) > 0.01) {
    g = (g + n / g) / 2.0; 
  }
  return g;
}

